stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> AUTOMATION_CONTROLLED
    AUTOMATION_CONTROLLED --> PAUSE_REQUESTED: intervention requested
    PAUSE_REQUESTED --> OPERATOR_CONTROLLED: automation quiesced and transfer accepted
    OPERATOR_CONTROLLED --> RESUME_REQUESTED: operator returns control
    RESUME_REQUESTED --> AUTOMATION_CONTROLLED: state revalidated and generation advanced
    AUTOMATION_CONTROLLED --> TERMINAL: complete, failed, cancelled, or timed out
    OPERATOR_CONTROLLED --> TERMINAL: operator completes or cancels
    PAUSE_REQUESTED --> TERMINAL: timeout or cancellation
    TERMINAL --> [*]

